1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:04,045
Who dares make me leave? I'm carrying a Jiang heir inside me

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,810
That's your grandchild. You'd let it be born out there?

3
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,904
Stop this act. At your age, how could you get pregnant?

4
00:00:16,079 --> 00:00:21,200
We're at a hospital, how could I lie? Please, son, I beg you

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:24,709
I'm already ruined, but the child is the Jiangs' only heir!

6
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:28,069
In my last life, I was killed over my husband's affair

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,870
This life, your whole family will pay in blood

8
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:37,229
Xiao Lan, come wash my feet. Zhang Guifang!

9
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,802
Don't push it. Oh, my precious son says

10
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:45,220
he wants Grandma to serve him personally. If she doesn't do it well

11
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:48,360
he won't come out. We'll all stay in here, let's see who panics

12
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:54,300
Honey

13
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:56,011
Honey, calm down. Careful, the baby!

14
00:00:57,920 --> 00:01:07,683
She only tolerates you because you carry a Jiang heir. Sweep away. Something's off

15
00:01:12,090 --> 00:01:16,578
Way off. Jiang Chengao's look... that's not how you look at a daughter-in-law

16
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:24,414
Gently! I'm carrying your child. Don't crush it

